[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=22 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="公共屋准备给外海来的旅人腾一张床。负责人把几位常来的人都问遍，没人记得他这次约的是哪一天。有人说应该明天，也有人说已经晚了两天。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="先把床留着，省得人来了没地方躺。就是旁边有人要借去放工具，我又不敢一直空着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="他以前有固定的时间吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="大致有，跟潮走。说今天来，也可能明早到。你们船快，就觉得一晚差很多，他那条艇不这么算。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把他的几张留言放在一起。没有一张写“今天一定到”，都是大概时间和路上停靠处。唯一很肯定的是，他答应给一个孩子带一把能开罐头的小刀。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这样，我们不碰他那些可能变的日子，问上一次确认在哪儿。有实消息再说，不让大家每过一小时就猜一次坏事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯查到前一个信标收过回报，旅人没有失联，只是临时接了两位要去医棚的人，绕路慢了。他的船一次发不出很长的话，前面的人没把后半句完整传过来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我们要通知家人吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="按他允许的联系人通知。别把载过谁、谁去看病一起广播。人活着和所有人都该知道他今天做什么，是两回事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="管事听到以后，先骂他一句总不把话说全，又高高兴兴把床单换好。你提起工具能不能暂放旁边，管事说可以，不过得留够一个人半夜进门不绊倒的路。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你看，先前那张床本来就不是只能一直空或者彻底让给工具。好多争执是人在心里先把选项减到两个了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你是在教我？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="有一点，也是在说我自己。我刚才差点就让他们别等，来了再找办法。要是他真半夜到，我又得把人从被窝里薅起来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旅人第二天清晨到，真的带了小刀，却没给孩子直接用。他让孩子先拿空罐练，让旁边有人看，再去开要吃的那只。孩子嫌慢，他也没迁就。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="旅人"

speaker_name=""

text="刀不是买回来就会用。等我睡醒，你要还想练，我陪你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你问他为什么不早点传出完整的信，他指着船尾一处接过的线，说再多发一段就可能全听不见，所以只发了自己觉得最要紧的。你告诉他留下的人还缺什么，他认真记下，并没有因为活着回来就觉得所有担心都不该发生。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="旅人"

speaker_name=""

text="下次我先说“预计晚到，人平安”，再说去过哪里。这个放最前面，断了也能剩半句。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="好。信标也改转发顺序，不让你的后半句永远在人少的时候被省掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们一起补好记录。公共屋那张床终于有了人，工具箱挪在墙边。你忽然觉得，如果未来真有人来找自己，希望他也会先留这样一句能让别人好好过夜的话，而不是一个必须所有人等着解开的秘密。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "perkins"])

actor_tones={}

